{"title":"New York MathCounts","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>New York MathCounts</b> competition is held in Saratoga Springs, NY. Countdown is unofficial.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: History\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prior to 2022, Mathcounts NY was held at RPI in Troy, NY.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"State_Competition_Results\">State Competition Results</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: State Competition Results\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>2026\n</p>\n<ul><li>Top 6 students: Victor Yang, Derrick Chen, Alan Ji, Zale Zhang, Isabella Kim, Nolan He</li>\n<li>Countdown winners: Victor Yang, Kyle Wang, Zale Zhang, Kenton Pack</li>\n<li>Top 3 schools: NEST+m, Great Neck South, Horace Mann</li></ul>\n<p>2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Top 6 students: Hanru Zhang, Victor Yang, Derrick Chen, Ryan Zhang, Aaron Xu, William Zhou</li>\n<li>Top 4 Countdown Round: Aaron Xu, Victor Yang, Derrick Chen, Hanru Zhang</li>\n<li>Top 3 schools: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.jericho-news-journal.com/articles/mathcounts-team-places-first-at-state-competition/\">Jericho</a>, Great Neck North, Horace Mann</li></ul>\n<p>2024\n</p>\n<ul><li>Top 7 students: Ben Song, Derrick Chen, Ryan Zhang, Ethan Li, Tianze Qiu, Ethan Han, Mihir Kumar</li>\n<li>Top 4 Countdown Round: Ethan Li, Ryan Zhang, Derrick Chen, Christopher Lamtan</li>\n<li>Top 3 schools: Jericho, Great Neck North, Speyer</li></ul>\n<p>2023\n</p>\n<ul><li>Top 6 students: Gabe Per, Henry Xue, Samuel Lin, Henry Gao, Ryan Zhang, Jason Lian</li>\n<li>Top 4 schools: Jericho, Hunter College, Ardsley, Shaker</li></ul>\n<p>2020\n</p>\n<ul><li>Top 6 students: Alan Bu (Bethlehem), Rohan Sastry (Speyer), Davis Zong (Hunter College), James Lian (Iroquois), Michael Lu, Justin Mo</li></ul>\n<p>2017\n</p>\n<ul><li>Top 2 schools: Jericho Middle School, Iroquois Middle School</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NY_State_National_Team_Qualifiers\">NY State National Team Qualifiers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NY State National Team Qualifiers\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>2026\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=NEST%2Bm&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NEST+m (page does not exist)\">NEST+m</a> Coach Johanna Cinquegrana</li>\n<li>Derrick Chen <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Horace_Mann_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Horace Mann School (page does not exist)\">Horace Mann School</a></li>\n<li>Alan Ji <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Herricks_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Herricks Middle School (page does not exist)\">Herricks Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Victor Yang <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Great_Neck_North_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Great Neck North Middle School (page does not exist)\">Great Neck North Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Zale Zhang <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Great_Neck_South_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Great Neck South Middle School (page does not exist)\">Great Neck South Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Nationals: 3rd place</li></ul>\n<p>2025\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Great_Neck_North_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Great Neck North Middle School (page does not exist)\">Great Neck North Middle School</a> Coach Zach Boyt</li>\n<li>Hanru Zhang <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jericho&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Jericho (page does not exist)\">Jericho</a></li>\n<li>Victor Yang <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Great_Neck_North_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Great Neck North Middle School (page does not exist)\">Great Neck North Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Derrick Chen <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Horace_Mann_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Horace Mann School (page does not exist)\">Horace Mann School</a></li>\n<li>Ryan Zhang <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jericho&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Jericho (page does not exist)\">Jericho</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.greatneck.k12.ny.us/posts-detail-news-accolades/~board/news-accolades/post/new-york-state-mathcounts-team-honored-for-second-place-finish-at-nationals\">Nationals: 2nd place</a></li></ul>\n<p>2024\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Great_Neck_North_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Great Neck North Middle School (page does not exist)\">Great Neck North Middle School</a> Coach Zach Boyt</li>\n<li>Ben Song <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Derrick Chen <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Horace_Mann_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Horace Mann School (page does not exist)\">Horace Mann School</a></li>\n<li>Ryan Zhang <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Jericho&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Jericho (page does not exist)\">Jericho</a></li>\n<li>Ethan Li <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=H.B._Thompson_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"H.B. Thompson Middle School (page does not exist)\">H.B. Thompson Middle School</a></li>\n<li>17th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2023\n</p>\n<ul><li>Gabe Per, Henry Xue, Samuel Lin, Henry Gao</li>\n<li>23rd place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2022\n</p>\n<ul><li>14th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2021\n</p>\n<ul><li>Andrew Carratu</li>\n<li>3rd place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2020-2021 (COVID)\n</p><p>2019\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://scarsdale10583.com/section-table/100-parenting/7455-sms-mathcounts-team-places-first-in-state?fb_comment_id=2410780515654521_2411309982268241\">Scarsdale Middle School</a> Coach Steve Weiss</li>\n<li>Matthew Zhao <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scarsdale_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Scarsdale Middle School (page does not exist)\">Scarsdale Middle School</a></li>\n<li>9th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2018\n</p>\n<ul><li>19th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2017\n</p>\n<ul><li>Steven Schmidt (coach, Iroquois Middle School)</li>\n<li>Rowechen Zhong, Maxwell Ruiyang Sun, Rishabh Das, David Li</li>\n<li>19th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2016\n</p>\n<ul><li>14th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nysspe.org/2015/04/07/nysspe-coordinates-2015-new-york-state-mathcounts-competition/\">2015</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a> Coach</li>\n<li>Raymond Feng <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Alan Tu <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Eric Wei <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scarsdale_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Scarsdale Middle School (page does not exist)\">Scarsdale Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Derrick Xiong <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Horace_Mann_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Horace Mann Middle School (page does not exist)\">Horace Mann Middle School</a></li>\n<li>8th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2014\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scarsdale_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Scarsdale Middle School (page does not exist)\">Scarsdale Middle School</a> Coach Steve Weiss</li>\n<li>Raymond Feng <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Alan Tu <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Richard Xu <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scarsdale_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Scarsdale Middle School (page does not exist)\">Scarsdale Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Eric Wei <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scarsdale_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Scarsdale Middle School (page does not exist)\">Scarsdale Middle School</a></li>\n<li>4th place at Nationals</li></ul>\n<p>2013\n</p>\n<ul><li>Raymond Feng <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Alan Tu <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calkins_Road_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calkins Road Middle School (page does not exist)\">Calkins Road Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Derrick Xiong <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Horace_Mann&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Horace Mann (page does not exist)\">Horace Mann</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://qns.com/2013/05/queens-teen-wins-prestigious-math-honors/\">Jena Yun</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Russell_Sage_JHS_190_(Queens)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Russell Sage JHS 190 (Queens) (page does not exist)\">Russell Sage JHS 190 (Queens)</a></li></ul>\n<p>2012\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://albanyareamathcircle.blogspot.com/2012/05/ny-team-sets-new-heights-at-mathcounts.html\">4th place at Nationals</a></li></ul>\n<p>2010\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bay_Trail_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Bay Trail Middle School (page does not exist)\">Bay Trail Middle School</a> Coach Laura Bobin</li>\n<li>Allen Liu <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bay_Trail_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Bay Trail Middle School (page does not exist)\">Bay Trail Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Thomas Dumbach <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hunter_College_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Hunter College Middle School (page does not exist)\">Hunter College Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Bailey Liao <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Candlewood_Middle_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Candlewood Middle School (page does not exist)\">Candlewood Middle School</a></li>\n<li>Richard Yip <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Horace_Mann_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Horace Mann School (page does not exist)\">Horace Mann School</a></li></ul>\n<p>2009\n</p><p>2008\n</p>\n<ul><l